9|0@relationships^1438926136#ctuip87:ThrownMaxibon$:One specific thing you should know is the baby isn't going to hate you unless you mistreat it for most of its life. You two are not going to be equals. You are so much older than it. It will see you as almost a parent. The baby will probably come to you to ask you to read it stories or comfort it. Once it's old enough to talk it is not going to straight away day *"I hate you"* It's going it want you to give it love and pay attention to it. If you can do that you'll be the amazing big brother that it looks up to and wants to be like. Once it's a teenager and starts rebelling against your mom that kid will be able to talk to you about what it's going through. Talk to your mom about all the things your worried about. Just let her now you're scared, but you're still happy for the baby. 
