3|0@relationships^1438929600#ctujw0o:LobsterManFightClub$:My mom had a baby when I was 18. It's going to be different but, you know what? It would be different anyways. You're becoming an adult. You don't need as much from your mom as you did yesterday, and tomorrow you'll need even less. This will be a good way for you to learn some independence while still being at home. Talk to your mom and tell her how you're feeling. But understand that even if things change they were going to change anyways. 
