19|0@relationships^1438917273#ctuenui:thesockbunny$:My sister was 16 and my mom was 40 when I was born. She was also worried about a baby so late in the game, but I ended up being like a little baby for her too. I've always considered myself also raised by my sister, she was so great to me growing up. She's always been the best at advice and I also always looked up to her. I am sure this new baby will be that way for you too. 
