5|0@relationships^1438921279#ctugnqn:springplum$:Other people you can talk to are any friends or acquaintances at school who also have much younger siblings at home. There might not be a lot with 16 year age gaps, but I bet you'll find plenty with brothers or sisters 10-14 years younger than they are.
